{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>上水清曉路一個地盤今日上午發生工業意外。一名工程師遭鐵枝插傷下顎，要連人帶鐵枝送到醫院處理，現正進行手術。消息稱，事主在地盤一平台上檢查鋼筋時疑踏空，失平衡向前跌，跌向一支垂直的鋼筋，導致該鋼筋從其下方穿透下顎。</p><figure><img alt=\"傷者送院時下顎還插有鐵枝。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192826761658765312174325.jpeg/hu0dLeUBoCxvsZolByBoRdTmUigVZUIzy0mh58tJoec\"/><figcaption>傷者送院時下顎還插有鐵枝。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傷者送院時下顎還插有鐵枝。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192826763793797120916320.jpeg/kUHRINL0chcm5Xly2ljNcSFxl3Ze7uXvQxuWzEMblsw\"/><figcaption>傷者送院時下顎還插有鐵枝。</figcaption></figure><p>消息稱，傷者32歲姓黃，屬資深結構工程師，負責工地內的鋼筋檢查及監察施工進度。事發時他與另外3名工程師在地盤內檢查鋼筋時，他站在木板平台上疑踏空，失平衡向前跌，跌向一支垂直的鋼筋；導致該鋼筋從其下方穿透下顎。</p><p>勞工處回覆《香港01》查詢表示，已知悉事件，並已展開調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"鐵枝上有敷料。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192811681449775104192380.jpeg/JdVPwcKwzYHt3TXU73DiXgc-orMX8I02t7sDRbe7A0U\"/><figcaption>鐵枝上有敷料。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鐵枝上有敷料。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192811699812962304568420.jpeg/l62W5KJv8xtcaRBAfMRl1kI1K2Qa9h7Y9RQGmPUUBpg\"/><figcaption>鐵枝上有敷料。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是房署的地盤。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192811697153642496603589.jpeg/PowXiHfbhksRTtxyOpTjuQXVRnROy9gUHYJCkx2CQpM\"/><figcaption>現場是房署的地盤。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是房署的地盤。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192811691642064896537294.jpeg/YFnMuX9lOvAYMsQE8hKGW8tQO1SKcOSTAp-_UwKfv1M\"/><figcaption>現場是房署的地盤。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是房署的地盤。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192811688013860864219573.jpeg/TFJ5MdOwGXdC6_evl9MI-EK5yBDdjxjdzJxPfsycT34\"/><figcaption>現場是房署的地盤。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勞工處等人員到場調查。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192821841547235328354926.jpeg/77s1e4T3ubBwlYrwuXr0a0aQ2Z18nUb2JP10riT9dK4\"/><figcaption>勞工處等人員到場調查。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勞工處等人員到場調查。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192821844554682368236791.jpeg/kTSI0QObRaZdGCmDeUqONfYVPv9ZM3lfX7PKxF-zysQ\"/><figcaption>勞工處等人員到場調查。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勞工處等人員到場調查。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192821847495020544654128.jpeg/XW3FThnIsbngNrl1GoNOHg4HMXHXQ9_l9zgXxPc4F8Q\"/><figcaption>勞工處等人員到場調查。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勞工處等人員到場調查。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192821850628296704863514.jpeg/kN5dY9Et1dbMziFTxF9csh9DVrLEdoui6SMzAOkjMwA\"/><figcaption>勞工處等人員到場調查。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勞工處等人員到場調查。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192821854629793792812369.jpeg/sZi2KzgpH5HK0NdnXjWSAMR52OzuVrk7VIHFBFSBxQQ\"/><figcaption>勞工處等人員到場調查。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T10:32:26.315899+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":435,"images":12,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T07:02:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T10:23:57.022296+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T10:23:57.022296+00:00","content_hash":"416a89708641ef210d6054cae3947f75e1d1b8b8eff25be920d7dbff0b976397","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}